{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act9d0_level_act9d0_05_end",
  "groupId": "act9d0",
  "stageId": "act9d0_07",
  "title": "龜裂",
  "storyCode": "DM-7",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act9d0/level_act9d0_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "48e9b07353e9bd9dd281ec67d4092cf34c510f755fd64b427cd61589a813b235",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "塔露拉變了。\n第一次見到塔露拉的時候，她給我的感覺，和特蕾西婭殿下很像。\n但殿下一直非常的悲傷，她背負著......也知曉著這片大地的更多秘密。\n塔露拉不同，她很憤怒，足夠冷靜的，卻又充滿熱情的憤怒。\n雖然細小很多，卻同樣強盛。也許他們這樣的人無論力量大小，都擁有著近似的部分。\n這股憤怒催生了整合運動，讓無數追隨者趨之若鶩。\n但很快......就改變了。\n我們每天的工作，變成了煽動、加害和挑撥。\n這不再是一場感染者的革命——\n——而是我們在卡茲戴爾目睹過無數次的，被過度操縱的戰爭陰謀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "她沒有追上來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......如果我們真的和她正面碰上，事情就麻煩了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "你不該對塔露拉使用法術，這也不是第一次了，我們要時常小心自己看見的東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "......塔露拉的身上一定發生了什麼，這件事必須告訴W。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "多虧了W幾次的小動作，我們已經遭到那些暴徒的猜忌了，這還不夠嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "你到底看到了什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "過去的塔露拉只是個反抗者。她把反抗的機會帶給那些被解放的感染者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "現在呢？他們幾乎毫不收斂自己的欲望，單純的破壞，濫殺。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "這不足以說明什麼，薩卡茲之外的種族對感染者素來如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "......你不明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "我不是在說這種行為本身怎麼了，我是在說這樣的行為會招致什麼後果......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "塔露拉她......在葬送整合運動，刻意的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "......為什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "你不覺得這個情況似曾相識嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "她是個優秀的領袖，能將這些普通的感染者捲入戰爭，甚至帶給他們勝利。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "但她，也只有她才能用最神不知鬼不覺的方法，一步步毀掉自己一手搭建起來的高塔。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "甚至......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "甚至塔露拉她自己，都只是其中一塊比較精美的磚瓦，隨時可以被粉碎。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "你是在說......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "和三年前給我的感覺一樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "但他......他或許素來如此，他可以毫不猶豫地做到這一切......只是藏的很好罷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "塔露拉不同，她的變化太突然了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "她的影子......她甚至有兩個影子，不像是法術的痕跡，倒像是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "一座廢墟，古老，強盛，滿是那種力量的殘留......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "你的法術性質很特殊，儘管如此，你這次的感覺也太模糊了，這還是不構成行動的理由。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "但這件事W必須知道！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "小聲點，我們已經被注意到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "任何動作都會成為別人的把柄，你明白的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "那你覺得我們還能經受住第二次巴別塔那樣的變故嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "我不確定......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "......至少W不能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "我去找她，既然加爾森已經死了，她就是新的領導人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "text": "等等！如果塔露拉真的已經注意到了，你這樣會——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "等不了，別想命令我，現在我們還是平起平坐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "......哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "話是這麼說，這好像是我第一次抗命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "你不該總是想這麼多的，赫德雷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "（W，就在前面，穿過這條巷子就......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "（那裡不是營地？她在做什麼？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "（總之得快一點——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "——誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動士兵",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "感染者......？有什麼事嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動士兵",
      "text": "注意你的語氣，魔族。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動士兵",
      "text": "先是有幾支傭兵隊伍叛逃，接著又讓敵人出現在了城內。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動士兵",
      "text": "你們犯下的錯誤太多，你該不會以為領袖沒有看在眼裡吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "讓開，我沒有義務聽你抱怨。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動士兵",
      "text": "你有這個義務對塔露拉負責。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "——我明白了，等我向W彙報完之後，我會去向塔露拉報到。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動士兵",
      "text": "不必了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動士兵",
      "text": "我們需要的不是這種“負責”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "什麼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "嘖.....來真的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動士兵",
      "text": "剛才發生的襲擊波及了這裡，薩卡茲雇傭兵小隊長之一的伊內絲，死亡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅毅的整合運動術師",
      "text": "不去確認她的屍體？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動士兵",
      "text": "......剛才的戰鬥動靜太大，已經有人被吸引過來了，立刻炸毀這條街道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅毅的整合運動術師",
      "text": "是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動士兵",
      "text": "等等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動士兵",
      "text": "整合運動也要有人......和她一併奮戰到了最後。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅毅的整合運動術師",
      "text": "......我明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "堅毅的整合運動術師",
      "text": "照顧好我的家人，他們還在城裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動士兵",
      "text": "當然，我向你許諾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動士兵",
      "text": "......把他的屍體弄得再像回事一些......好，就這樣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動士兵",
      "text": "W很快就會察覺到的......我們走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "沒讓赫德雷跟來......果然，是正確的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "......嘖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "原來，切爾諾伯格街道上的景觀樹......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "居然......是樺樹......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "......哈哈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "text": "差不多的風景，和那裡......都是，交叉的影子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
